{
  "schema_version": "phase2k-league-lexical-vocabulary-v2",
  "purpose": "Bounded League of Legends lexical snapshot used only as Pass 1 mechanical-cleanup hints (ability keys, common summoner spells, basic domain tokens, and explicit champion alias spelling rules). It is intentionally not a semantic ontology and carries no ownership or champion-binding information; champion alias rules are lexical spelling data only and never produce entities, bindings, events, or relations.",
  "scope_note": "No ownership inference, no champion/role/motif classification, no champion binding, and no strategic abstraction. Champion alias hints are deterministic exact word-boundary spelling hints; guarded aliases require champion-shaped local syntax, metadata-licensed aliases require the supplied metadata value, and the never/uncertainty-only list must never be auto-repaired. Hints may only disambiguate local ASR surface forms in Pass 1 text restoration.",
