        "canonical": "Kayle",
        "match_case": "initial_capital",
        "note": "Capital-initial Kale surfaces are unconditional Kayle hints; lowercase 'kale' (grocery/vegetable usage) is never eligible. The capitalization guard is documented and encoded in this rule."
